 <h3><u>Be maqna o chadar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Be makna o chadar sar e bazaar hai zenab<br> Abbas khule sar sare bazaar hai zenab</p> 
  <p>1-Ek baar bas ek baar mujhe dekh le bhayya<br> Ey mere madadgaar mujhe dekh le bhayya<br> Mar jayegi khahar sare bazaar hai zenab….1</p> 
  <p>2-Me teri behan hoo’n ye zamane ko khabar hai<br> har dekhne wale ki mere sar pe nazar hai<br> purdard hai manzar sare bazaar hai zenab……2</p> 
  <p>3-bin bhai ke ek behan ka kya jeene me jeena<br> abbas sehan kaise karoo’n phat ta hai seena<br> mar janaa hai behtar&nbsp; sare bazaar hai zenab……..3</p> 
  <p>4-de hukm ke phat jaye zamee’n mujhko sama le<br> be dard zamane ki jafao’n se bacha le<br> ey waqt ke haider sare bazaar hai zenab……….4</p> 
  <p>5-dauraan e safar sar pe tera hath hai bhayya<br> itna hi bahot hai tu mere sath hai bhayya<br> ek tere hi dam par sare bazaar hai zenab………..5</p> 
  <p>6-kal tere bharose pe chali thi mai watan se<br> kya baat hai kuchh bol to ey bhai behan se<br> ey azm ke paikar sare bazaar hai zenab………6</p> 
  <p>7-rehwaar ki garden me hai is waqt tera sar<br> abbas magar phir bhi larazte hai sitamgar<br> is dar ki bina par sare bazaar hai zenab……….7</p> 
  <p>8-is waste deti hoo’n musalsal me sadaye’n<br> hoti hain yaha’n mujhpe jafao’n pe jafaye’n<br> ey mere ghazanfar sare bazaar hai zenab……..8</p> 
  <p>9-asif&nbsp; ho raqam kaise ghame zenab e muztar<br> aamir ho baya’n kaise ke zenab ke tha lab par<br> ye mera muqaddar sare bazaar hai&nbsp; zenab……9</p> 
